":"AUDIO","links":[14]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.40.0","Node name for S&R":"LoadAudio"},"widgets_values":["tong-zhuo-de-ni.wav",""],"widgets_values_named":{"audio":"tong-zhuo-de-ni.wav","upload":""}},{"id":16,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1480,420],"size":[370,280],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Markdown注释","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 模型链接\n\n### RVC推理模型权重和预训练模型\n\n- [fcpe.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Aero-Ex/ComfyUI-RVC/resolve/main/rvc/fcpe.safetensors)\n- [hubert_base.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Aero-Ex/ComfyUI-RVC/resolve/main/rvc/hubert_base.safetensors)\n- [rmvpe.safetensors)](https://huggingface.co/Aero-Ex/ComfyUI-RVC/resolve/main/rvc/rmvpe.safetensors)\n- [pretrained](https://huggingface.co/lj1995/VoiceConversionWebUI/tree/main/pretrained)\n- [pretrained_v2](https://huggingface.co/lj1995/VoiceConversionWebUI/tree/main/pretrained_v2)\n\n### 模型存放位置\nComfyUI/models/rvc/"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 模型链接\n\n### RVC推理模型权重和预训练模型\n\n- [fcpe.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Aero-Ex/ComfyUI-RVC/resolve/main/rvc/fcpe.safetensors)\n- [hubert_base.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Aero-Ex/ComfyUI-RVC/resolve/main/rvc/hubert_base.safetensors)\n- [rmvpe.safetensors)](https://huggingface.co/Aero-Ex/ComfyUI-RVC/resolve/main/rvc/rmvpe.safetensors)\n- [pretrained](https://huggingface.co/lj1995/VoiceConversionWebUI/tree/main/pretrained)\n- [pretrained_v2](https://huggingface.co/lj1995/VoiceConversionWebUI/tree/main/pretrained_v2)\n\n### 模型存放位置\nComfyUI/models/rvc/"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":17,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-420,700],"size":[480,650],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Markdown注释","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## pretrained 参数说明\n\n* 可以选择 `models/rvc` 目录下的任意 `*.pth` 模型都能选（包括你之前训练导出的音色模型），用它等于\"从某个已有音色继续微调\"；\n* 练全新声音时选官方 `f0G*.pth` 底座即可。\n\n### 必须与 dataset 的版本 + 采样率匹配\n\n以你数据集节点（RVC Train Dataset / Audio List）选的 version/sample_rate 为准：\n\n| dataset 配置 | pretrained 应选 |\n| --- | --- |\n| v2 + 48k | `f0G48k.pth`（来自 `pretrained_v2/`） |\n| v2 + 32k | `f0G32k.pth`（来自 `pretrained_v2/`） |\n| v1 + 40k | `f0G40k.pth`（来自 `pretrained/`） |\n| v1 + 32k / 48k | `f0G32k.pth` / `f0G48k.pth`（来自 `pretrained/`） |\n\n两个注意点：\n\n- **务必选 f0 变体**（`f0G*.pth`），不是无 f0 的 `G*.pth` —— 本插件只训练 f0 引导模型，[`_load_pretrained`](rvc_train/train.py#L294-L295) 遇到非 f0 文件会直接报错。\n- **版本不匹配会报错**（[L289](rvc_train/train.py#L289) 校验 `version`），但官方 `f0G*.pth` 不带采样率元数据，**采样率匹配靠你自己按文件名保证**——选错不会报错，只会训出坏模型。v2 没有 40k 配置，所以 v2 只配 32k/48k 两个文件。\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## pretrained 参数说明\n\n* 可以选择 `models/rvc` 目录下的任意 `*.pth` 模型都能选（包括你之前训练导出的音色模型），用它等于\"从某个已有音色继续微调\"；\n* 练全新声音时选官方 `f0G*.pth` 底座即可。\n\n### 必须与 dataset 的版本 + 采样率匹配\n\n以你数据集节点（RVC Train Dataset / Audio List）选的 version/sample_rate 为准：\n\n| dataset 配置 | pretrained 应选 |\n| --- | --- |\n| v2 + 48k | `f0G48k.pth`（来自 `pretrained_v2/`） |\n| v2 + 32k | `f0G32k.pth`（来自 `pretrained_v2/`） |\n| v1 + 40k | `f0G40k.pth`（来自 `pretrained/`） |\n| v1 + 32k / 48k | `f0G32k.pth` / `f0G48k.pth`（来自 `pretrained/`） |\n\n两个注意点：\n\n- **务必选 f0 变体**（`f0G*.pth`），不是无 f0 的 `G*.pth` —— 本插件只训练 f0 引导模型，[`_load_pretrained`](rvc_train/train.py#L294-L295) 遇到非 f0 文件会直接报错。\n- **版本不匹配会报错**（[L289](rvc_train/train.py#L289) 校验 `version`），但官方 `f0G*.pth` 不带采样率元数据，**采样率匹配靠你自己按文件名保证**——选错不会报错，只会训出坏模型。v2 没有 40k 配置，所以 v2 只配 32k/48k 两个文件。\n"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[9,2,1,11,0,"STRING"],[10,6,0,2,0,"RVC_DATASET"],[11,2,0,12,0,"STRING"],[3,7,0,6,0,"AUDIO"],[12,13,0,6,1,"AUDIO"],[13,14,0,6,2,"AUDIO"],[14,15,0,6,7,"AUDIO"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":1.1529256068180274,"offset":[1157.6452423631415,-255.0005014667599]}},"version":0.4}